WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.225
Lucy looked out the window.

2
00:00:07.226 --> 00:00:10.160
An object flew toward the ship.

3
00:00:10.161 --> 00:00:14.413
"Turn, Lucy!" Ringo cried.

4
00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.177
Lucy quickly turned the spaceship.

5
00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:21.049
The object flew by.

6
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.507
"Whew!" Lucy said.

7
00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:27.156
"That was close," Ringo said.

8
00:00:27.157 --> 00:00:30.500
"What was that thing?" Lucy asked.

9
00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:33.107
"Space junk," Bot said.

10
00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:37.289
"Space junk?" Lucy scratched her head.

11
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:41.576
"I tried to tell you," Bot said.

12
00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:44.121
"Planet Crud has space junk.

13
00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:49.531
Lots of it!"

14
00:00:49.532 --> 00:00:53.731
Junk floated everywhere.

15
00:00:53.732 --> 00:00:56.489
"Wow," Ringo said.

16
00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:04.844
"I see tools, wheels, springs . . ."

17
00:01:04.845 --> 00:01:08.171
"The signal is coming from there," PJ said.

18
00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:11.267
"We must fly through some junk."

19
00:01:11.268 --> 00:01:14.721
"Be careful, Lucy," Ringo said.

20
00:01:14.722 --> 00:01:21.785
Lucy rolled her eyes. "I will, Tiny."

21
00:01:21.786 --> 00:01:28.208
Lucy flew slowly.

22
00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:30.823
"Uh-oh," PJ said.

23
00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:34.089
"What's wrong, PJ?" Ringo asked.

24
00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:38.797
PJ pointed. "The satellite is over there."

25
00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:42.138
Ringo groaned.

26
00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:45.492
"In the middle of lots of junk!"

27
00:01:45.493 --> 00:01:48.099
"Yep," PJ said.

28
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.095
"Oh no," Bot said.

29
00:01:51.096 --> 00:01:54.603
"We can't fly into all that junk."

30
00:01:54.604 --> 00:01:57.780
Lucy nodded. "You're right.

31
00:01:57.781 --> 00:02:00.179
It's not safe."

32
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.379
"What will we do?" PJ said.

33
00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:08.876
"We have to get to that satellite."

34
00:02:08.877 --> 00:02:12.350
"There's only one thing to do," Ringo said.

35
00:02:12.351 --> 00:02:22.996
"We'll clean up the space junk!"

